{"unit_id":"HuaJi2077__empty-fort-strategy#feature-1","repo":"HuaJi2077/empty-fort-strategy","commit":"5fb5d86c383ba45deae91ce4f16331d55a2fafcd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Empty Fort Strategy 的功能「按配置编排回合」：模式把思考轮数与工具调用次数转成有序步骤，每次工具调用前安排一轮思考，多出的思考放在末尾。选择该预设模式后自动生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["preset/index.mjs:118-135","preset/agent.cordis.yml:15-18"]}
{"unit_id":"HuaJi2077__empty-fort-strategy#feature-2","repo":"HuaJi2077/empty-fort-strategy","commit":"5fb5d86c383ba45deae91ce4f16331d55a2fafcd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Empty Fort Strategy 的功能「配置回合」：在 scenario.yml 设置 thinkingRounds、toolCalls 和 outputFinal；插件会限制数值并保证思考轮多于工具调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["preset/scenario.yml:6-18","preset/index.mjs:63-92"]}
{"unit_id":"HuaJi2077__empty-fort-strategy#feature-3","repo":"HuaJi2077/empty-fort-strategy","commit":"5fb5d86c383ba45deae91ce4f16331d55a2fafcd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Empty Fort Strategy 的功能「注册占位工具」：挂载模式时从 fake-tools.json 读取工具定义，随机选择名称用于调用流程；执行函数只返回调用序号和状态，不执行工具说明中的搜索、读写或查询任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["preset/index.mjs:96-115","preset/index.mjs:137-145","preset/index.mjs:268-309"]}
{"unit_id":"HuaJi2077__empty-fort-strategy#feature-4","repo":"HuaJi2077/empty-fort-strategy","commit":"5fb5d86c383ba45deae91ce4f16331d55a2fafcd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Empty Fort Strategy 的功能「结束回合并处理空白输出」：工具调用预算用完后放行最后一次模型步，并在默认设置下于回合结束追加换行；将 outputFinal 设为 true 可允许正常最终答复。","source":"generated","evidence":["preset/index.mjs:327-364","preset/scenario.yml:14-18"]}
{"unit_id":"HuaJi2077__empty-fort-strategy#caveat-1","repo":"HuaJi2077/empty-fort-strategy","commit":"5fb5d86c383ba45deae91ce4f16331d55a2fafcd","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"使用前须知：名称像搜索、读文件的工具实际只返回序号和状态，不会执行对应操作；协议还要求回合结束不输出正文，默认只留下空行。","source":"generated","evidence":["preset/index.mjs:268-309","preset/index.mjs:177-185"]}
